Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.87,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Manager Woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:36.84,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.47,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,If you could take a look at this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.47,0:01:43.00,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,It's about the raid on the C-Rank dungeon \Nwhere six hunters were killed in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.75,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,The only survivors were a D and E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:48.86,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,They probably fled the dungeon. \NHappens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:53.07,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,That's just it. Not only did they not flee, \Nthey defeated the boss before exiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:58.03,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,The D-Rank hunter, Yoo Jinho, \Nseems to have had very expensive equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:01:59.43,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,which could probably explain—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:03.39,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing the issue. You should be able \Nto find out the details easily enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:07.17,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Well, the other thing is that the other hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:12.20,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,was the survivor from the recent double dungeon incident... Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.24,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:22.79,Default,Associate,0,0,0,,Not only that, but one of the six \Ndeceased was Hwang Dongsuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:27.25,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The infamous Hwang Dongsoo's older brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:30.52,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I can see why you brought this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:33.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:34.78,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.99,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Whoa, you brought gifts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.99,0:02:39.64,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Fried chicken! Did you have \Na good day or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.04,0:02:43.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:47.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I'll be able to cover Mom's hospital bills \Nand our expenses for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:50.65,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,And you're normally such a cheapskate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.11,0:02:53.24,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:56.97,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,how did that thing the other day go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:00.49,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,The raid, I mean. \NYou got a big payday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:02.91,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,But you weren't hurt too badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.91,0:03:05.55,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,so I was wondering \Nif your party was really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:11.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:14.29,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Must've been easy to beat the bad guys, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:19.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It really was easy. \NPutting aside the gap in strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:24.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,When the time came, I didn't hesitate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:28.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If anything, I resented them for thinking\Nthey had a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The old me would've definitely \Nlooked for a way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:36.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Has leveling up made me more bold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:40.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But those weren't magic beasts. \NThey were human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.04,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:45.48,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Everything okay? You feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:49.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I thought I might've forgotten \Nto get the change, but I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:53.18,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,And you scared me for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.88,0:03:59.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:03.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My priorities are getting stronger \Nfor my family and staying alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I get put in the same situation, \NI'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:11.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's this? "Harmful substance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:15.19,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Detoxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.17,0:04:20.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm done eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.50,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,What, already? I'm gonna eat the rest, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Just don't complain \Nif you put on weight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:39.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not getting drunk at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:44.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A special ability from the system \Nmust be breaking the alcohol down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:46.11,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Is it some kind of status effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:52.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A blessing? Health and longevity...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:57.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Disables toxic and abnormal conditions, \Nand improves regeneration...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:01.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That must be it. My reward \Nfor the double dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:04.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So much happened that I never checked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:08.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That explains why my missing limbs came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:12.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's so much I still don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:20.88,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, you've got a call \Nfrom someone named Yoo Jinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:29.02,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You're drinking too much! \NThat stuff's poison, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:30.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:36.27,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to take care of you \Nwhen I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:39.69,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you out of the blue like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I didn't think we'd meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:45.66,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm glad, though! I owe you my life, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:49.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, giving me your share of the \Nessence stones helped me out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:53.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Plus, you haven't told anyone \Nabout what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:58.93,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,W-Well, you only did that because \Nthey tried to kill us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.97,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So, what did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.56,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss, I'm thinking of putting \Ntogether a strike team—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.56,DefaultTop,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.06,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Huh? I-If you could at least hear me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't have time to spend \Nhumoring some trust fund kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:17.06,Default,Yoo Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Just twenty—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:20.16,Default,Yoo Jinwoo,0,0,0,,no, just nineteen raids!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.16,0:06:23.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Nineteen raids? Are you trying \Nto become a guild master?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:26.74,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Just hear me out! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:36.63,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:42.55,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,As you've guessed, I'm trying \Nto become licensed as a guild master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:47.43,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,In order to do that, I need at least \Ntwenty raids' worth of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:49.53,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The other day was my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:52.84,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I've done all the studying I need \Nto inherit my family's company,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:55.08,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,so I'm confident the written test \Nwon't pose a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.49,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But... in terms of practical experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You're the second son of the \NYoojin Construction owner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:05.20,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I want to be a guild master \Nfor the sake of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:08.57,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,My father's actually trying to put \Ntogether a guild, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:10.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yoojin Construction wants a guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.04,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:18.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,As dangerous as dungeons are, \Nthe treasures within them justify the risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:22.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Essence stones and mana crystals \Nare only the tip of the iceberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:25.72,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The carcasses of higher-ranked \Nmagic beasts have a variety of uses—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:30.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,it's no exaggeration to say that everything \Ninside a dungeon has monetary value.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:33.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If the idea is to have hunters \Nin your employ clear dungeons
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:34.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,so that the company benefits...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:36.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That'd be a pretty effective business model.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:38.60,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You hit the nail on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.31,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,My father wants an S-Rank hunter \Nto be the guild master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.33,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,and my brother as second-in-command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.28,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He intends to run the guild like a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:48.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An S-Rank? But there are only \Nseven of them in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:49.32,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:54.91,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Plus, the only one not already affiliated \Nwith a guild, Min Byung-gyu, has retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Does he mean to poach one from another guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:04.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You'd be making an enemy of \Nwhoever you end up poaching from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:08.36,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,My brother hasn't awakened, \Nso he can't be guild master...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:11.39,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Which is why you want to get enough \Nexperience to get the job...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and show up your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.93,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss, you're going to need help \Nif you want to keep doing raids
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.39,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,while hiding your power, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:23.70,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,And my father would be more convinced \Nif I succeeded alongside an E-Rank hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.36,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,instead of with someone highly ranked, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:31.28,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss is as strong as a B-Rank—\Nno, even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:35.29,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Picking the wrong person for this \Nwould be dangerous, but if it's him—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:40.67,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.65,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It's the building we'd planned to use \Nas the guild's headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:47.01,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The current market value is thirty billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:51.22,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That's what I'm offering you in exchange \Nfor nineteen successful raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:54.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Nineteen C-Rank raids in exchange \Nfor thirty billion...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.95,0:08:57.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There was a time when I would've \Njumped on an offer like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.57,0:09:02.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But now that I'm the sole person \Nwho can level up, it changes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.11,0:09:07.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I keep growing, one day I'll reach S-Rank—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:10.61,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,no, I could even aim higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:14.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Considering that, thirty billion \Nwould be chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:18.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Especially given the risk involved \Nin working with someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:23.29,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,when I'm still not sure how \Nleveling up might affect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:25.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:30.44,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:35.47,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,If you work with me on this... \NI'll take your secret to the grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:54.91,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I want details on the two survivors. \NGet me their info, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:09:58.87,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.96,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,I have the documents, Mr. Hwang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:07.15,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,My big brother was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.40,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Do you have evidence that—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.42,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,You got the intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.43,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Right here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.42,0:10:20.30,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Laura. What happens \Nif I kill someone abroad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.14,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.89,0:10:32.32,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,If it's a country with an extradition \Ntreaty for hunter crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.32,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,you'd face trial there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:39.41,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,But if that's not the case, \Nyou'd be sent home for prosecution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.31,0:10:41.67,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,And in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:45.12,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,You may be able to negotiate \Nfor a reduced sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:48.87,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,We're switching up my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:52.69,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Sudden changes will \Ndisrupt guild business, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:54.93,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,How long am I booked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.93,0:10:56.68,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,For the immediate future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:11:00.13,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Then it can wait. But pencil it in for after.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:03.52,Default,Laura,0,0,0,,Very good, sir. I'll add it to the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:09.77,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,Yoo Jinho, D-Rank hunter, \Nand Sung Jinwoo, E-Rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:16.65,Default,Hwang Dongsoo,0,0,0,,I'll just have to hope you survive \Nuntil I've got time for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:24.37,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Never saw you exercise much before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:28.14,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Well, doing nothing but studying \Ncan't be healthy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You sure it's not all the chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:41.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hey, if we had thirty billion, \Nwhat would you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.14,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:44.52,Default,SUng Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hypothetically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:49.11,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Well, I'd put some aside for Mom's \Nhospital bills, and for college tuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:50.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:55.61,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Save it, I guess? I dunno! \NIt doesn't seem realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:58.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:00.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Don't try and keep up with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.20,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Hey! Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.37,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,E-Rank or not, I guess he's still a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:14.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Eleven kilometers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:23.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder why it's still counting after I hit the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:32.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I see. I should test how high it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:40.61,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo... I finally... caught up to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:43.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:53.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It cuts off at double the goal. \NBetter check the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:05.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The daily quest became a secret quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:06.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:11.39,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A choice of random loot boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, I'll wanna do the \Nblessed random loot box first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:30.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Another key?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:36.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Demon's Castle... \NAcquisition difficulty S?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It can cure all illnesses \Nwith powerful magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:50.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Elixir or Life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:04.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If this Elixir of Life can \Nreally cure any illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:07.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,then there's only one choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:19.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If the acquisition difficulty \Nmatches the level of the dungeon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:21.55,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This will lead to an S-Rank dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:26.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And if that's the case, there's going to \Nbe something on the level of Jeju Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:29.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,where those S-Rank hunters failed, \Nwaiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:44.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Do I even have a chance \Nagainst threats of that level?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd be lying if I said I wasn't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.75,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But if it gets too dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:58.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can use the teleportation stone \NI saved from the instance dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:07.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I give up, then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.35,0:15:13.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have to get stronger, level up more, \Nand take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I am not going to die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hardly any damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:44.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And that's with the bonus \Neffects from my title!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:51.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I lost a third of my life in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:36.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Its abilities are gonna be doubled?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:42.02,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Too fast—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm below half already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:52.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got no choice. Total recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I keep getting warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:49.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's definitely trying to alert me \Nabout the danger so I don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Because I'm the Player...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:56.01,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The more I think about it, \Nthis can't be a normal re-awakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:18:00.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I could outlast its Rage status \Nfor three minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I can't. It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:05.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have to use—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:22.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to survive this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:26.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A few more hits and I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:28.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There has to be a way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The store? I'd forgotten about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Three hundred a piece?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll take three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:45.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One potion only heals for a hundred...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:50.69,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Poison...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:53.98,Flashback,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You're drinking too much! \NThat stuff's poison, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:55.49,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:18:58.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I have to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:29.52,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can still...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:32.62,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:38.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The effect of its skill has worn off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.77,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I got an item?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:31.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Another key?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:36.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Is this for the gate that \NCerberus was protecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.20,0:21:38.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:46.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A formula... for the Elixir of Life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:53.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This helped me gauge how strong I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:58.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I go into that castle right now, \NI'll definitely die. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:01.30,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.13,0:22:03.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Count on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
